  12:  * Creates a JDK dynamic proxy wrapping the transform dispatch.
  13:  * The proxy hides the underlying compiler and generated handler from callers,
  14:  * surfacing only the PipelineExecutor interface.
  15:  *
  16:  * The InvocationHandler is a lambda (hidden class at runtime).
  17:  * The generated transform class is NOT a hidden class — it is loaded via
  18:  * ClassLoadingStrategy.Default.INJECTION into the regular classloader.
  19:  */
